   "section": "Section B",
   "stem": "Let $\\vec{a} = 9\\hat{i} - 13\\hat{j} + 25\\hat{k}$, $\\vec{b} = 3\\hat{i} + 7\\hat{j} - 13\\hat{k}$ and $\\vec{c} = 17\\hat{i} - 2\\hat{j} + \\hat{k}$ be three given vectors. If $\\vec{r}$ is a vector such that $\\vec{r} \\times \\vec{a} = (\\vec{b} + \\vec{c}) \\times \\vec{a}$ and $\\vec{r} \\cdot (\\vec{b} - \\vec{c}) = 0$, then $\\frac{|593\\vec{r} + 67\\vec{a}|^{2}}{(593)^{2}}$ is equal to ______.",
